r me being a programmer  so i got really really lucky i am very  lucky  but i also worked hard  so what i've learned  there are lots of ways to be successful  and also success is defined differently  for everyone  a good rule of thumb  is to pursue projects and opportunities  that you can learn from  that you can grow from  because in the end successful outcomes  are pretty much luck  so if you want to succeed it's a numbers  game like rolling the dice  so keep rolling the dice you can't  control the outcomes of your dice rolls  but you can control what dice you use  and the more you work on yourself the  more the dice become weighted to your  advantage  so eventually you'll hit jackpot as long  as you keep rolling the dice  you'll achieve success whatever that  means  for you specifically  anyways that's it for the video  see ya

